      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow, that's really strong. \"moral dereliction\" is a heavy hitter. i love it. can you wrap it up with a final call to action that basically tells people that if they choose not to vote, they've essentially forfeited their right to complain about how the city is run? like, if you won't do the work of participating, you don't get a say in the outcome.",
